deo creation and animation framework that allows developers and coding agents to build videos using standard web technologies. It supports programmatic composition, interactive editing, design systems, and scalable batch rendering on local or cloud infrastructure.\n* **GPU Required:** **No** (Runs on CPU via Node.js and headless Chromium; hardware acceleration is optional).\n* **Minimum RAM:** **2 GB – 4 GB** (Baseline memory required for Node.js and headless browser rendering).\n\n---\n\n### 2. **remotion-motion-graphics-skill-main**\n* **Summary:** This repository provides a suite of Agent Skills that teach AI coding agents to create broadcast-quality motion graphics and visual assets using Remotion. It enforces structured production gates, continuous camera choreographies, authentic terminal demos, and editorial highlight cards without human keyframing.\n* **GPU Required:** **No** (Executes via Remotion on CPU).\n* **Minimum RAM:** **2 GB – 4 GB** (Standard Remotion / Node.js execution footprint).\n\n---\n\n### 3. **video-shotcraft-main**\n* **Summary:** video-shotcraft is an AI agent skill that transforms coding assistants into motion-design studios for creating cinematic product promos and demo videos with Remotion. It includes 152 shot recipe cards, 209 motion styles/previews, sound design passes, and an Ink Press promo template with CapCut/JianYing draft export support.\n* **GPU Required:** **No** (Tested on headless 2-core CPU environments using Remotion).\n* **Minimum RAM:** **2 GB – 4 GB** (Requires single-concurrency rendering on low-spec hardware).\n\n---\n\n### 4. **MoneyPrinterTurbo**\n* **Summary:** MoneyPrinterTurbo is an all-in-one AI short-video generator that automates scriptwriting, asset matching, voice synthesis, subtitle generation, and background music from a single topic or keyword. It provides WebUI, API, CLI, and AI agent interfaces with support for leading cloud and local AI providers.\n* **GPU Required:** **No** (Optional for faster local transcription with Faster-Whisper or local batch generation).\n* **Minimum RAM:** **4 GB** (Official documentation specifies: 4 GB minimum, 8 GB recommended, 16+ GB optimal).\n\n---\n\n### 5. **OpenReels**\n* **Summary:** OpenReels is an open-source TypeScript pipeline that turns any topic into a publish-ready vertical short video with a single command. It orchestrates web research, scriptwriting, voiceover generation, AI image/video creation, AI music composition, and spring-animated captions composited in Remotion.\n* **GPU Required:** **No** (Uses cloud APIs for LLM/visuals/TTS and CPU-based Remotion/FFmpeg for rendering).\n* **Minimum RAM:** **2 GB – 4 GB** (Docker setup specifies `--shm-size=2gb` for headless Chromium rendering).\n\n---\n\n### 6. **OpenMontage**\n* **Summary:** OpenMontage is an open-source agentic video production system that enables AI coding assistants to research, script, generate assets, and assemble polished video compositions. It supports both React-based Remotion and HTML/GSAP HyperFrames rendering, along with automated retrieval from open archives and stock providers.\n* **GPU Required:** **No** (Core workflows use cloud APIs and CPU tools like Piper TTS and Remotion; optional GPU dependencies exist for local video models like Wan 2.1).\n* **Minimum RAM:** **4 GB** (Python environment, Node.js Remotion renderer, Piper TTS, and FFmpeg).\n\n---\n\n### 7. **Open-Generative-AI**\n* **Summary:** Open Generative AI is an open-source desktop and web studio for generating AI images, videos, audio, and lip-sync media across 400+ models without content filters or subscriptions. Powered by MuAPI, it features built-in support for multi-image prompts, camera workflows, and both local (sd.cpp/Wan2GP) and cloud generation engines.\n* **GPU Required:** **No for cloud mode / basic SD 1.5; Yes/Recommended for local diffusion and video models** (CUDA/Metal GPU needed for local Wan2GP / sd.cpp acceleration).\n* **Minimum RAM:** **4 GB – 8 GB** for cloud/SD 1.5 usage; **16 GB** recommended for local Transformer/Z-Image models (base 8 GB can hang under heavy local models).\n\n---\n\n### 8. **claude-seo**\n* **Summary:** Claude SEO is an open-source SEO audit and analysis plugin for Claude Code that runs 25 sub-skills and 18 specialist agents in parallel across technical SEO, content quality (E-E-A-T), Schema.org, and AI search optimization (GEO). It generates prioritized, falsifiable action plans grounded in primary-source Google guidelines.\n* **GPU Required:** **No** (Pure Python and CLI-based web scraping, parsing, and Playwright Chromium headless execution).\n* **Minimum RAM:** **1 GB – 2 GB** (Standard Python runtime and headless browser memory footprint).\n\n---\n\n### 9. **agency-agents**\n* **Summary:** The Agency is a collection of specialized, personality-driven AI agent personas and workflows designed for software engineering, design, marketing, product, and strategy tasks. It can be installed into AI coding tools (Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, Gemini CLI, Antigravity) to provide dedicated domain experts with proven deliverables.\n* **GPU Required:** **No** (Collection of markdown prompt files and shell integration scripts).\n* **Minimum RAM:** **Minimal (< 512 MB)** (Negligible storage/memory requirement as it contains markdown instruction files).\n\n---\n\n### 10. **superpowers**\n* **Summary:** Superpowers is a software development methodology and composable skill framework for AI coding agents that enforces structured scoping, test-driven development (TDD), and subagent orchestration. It prevents AI assistants from hallucinating or drifting by breaking work into verifiable, testable steps before writing code.\n* **GPU Required:** **No** (Markdown instructions and skills for AI agent harnesses).\n* **Minimum RAM:** **Minimal (< 512 MB)** (Text/instruction files only).\n\n---\n\n### 11. **last30days-skill-main**\n* **Summary:** /last30days is an AI agent research skill and search engine that queries real-time sentiment and engagement across Reddit, X, YouTube, TikTok, Hacker News, Polymarket, and GitHub. It synthesizes multi-platform data, top community comments, and engagement metrics into a concise brief covering recent events.\n* **GPU Required:** **No** (Lightweight Python/Node scripts, API integrations, and web scrapers).\n* **Minimum RAM:** **1 GB – 2 GB** (Standard lightweight CLI/scripting environment).\n\n---\n\n### 12. **marketingskills**\n* **Summary:** Marketing Skills is a repository of specialized AI agent skills covering conversion rate optimization (CRO), copywriting, SEO, paid advertising, and growth marketing. It equips AI coding agents with battle-tested frameworks, interrelated context trees, and best practices across the marketing lifecycle.\n* **GPU Required:** **No** (Collection of markdown skill definition documents).\n* **Minimum RAM:** **Minimal (< 512 MB)** (Instructional markdown files only).","Recipient":"b75d3ef6-c7ea-497e-a92f-fe05edd5e5c3","toolAction":"Sending summary report to parent agent","toolSummary":"Send research findings to parent"}}]}
